( Owns learned facts and a three-field hypothesis. No inventory or scene state.
  ZP 00 facts, 01-03 choices, 04 verdict, 05 result applied, fe send error.
  Director input: action 1..9 or two-byte returned-page result.
  Reply: message facts who entry object verdict. )
|0100
 ;receive #d0 DEO2 #0800 #d2 DEO2
 #0900 #d6 DEO2 #06 #d8 DEO #01 #dc DEO BRK
@receive
 #dd DEI #01 NEQ ?done
 #d4 DEI #02 EQU ?result
 #d4 DEI #01 NEQ ?done
 #0800 LDA #01 LTH ?done #0800 LDA #09 GTH ?done
 #00 #04 STZ
 #0800 LDA #06 LTH ?observe
 #0800 LDA #09 EQU ?test
 ( Actions 6..8 map to ZP 01..03. Cycle unanswered -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 1. )
 #0800 LDA #05 SUB DUP LDZ INC DUP #04 NEQ ?choice
 POP #01
 @choice SWP STZ #06 !reply
@observe
 #00 #0800 LDA #01 SUB ;evidence ADD2 LDA #00 LDZ ORA #00 STZ
 #0800 LDA !reply
@result
 #0800 LDA2 #0a01 NEQ2 ?done
 #00 LDZ #18 AND #18 NEQ ?done #05 LDZ ?done
 #01 #05 STZ #00 #04 STZ #0b !reply
@test
 #00 LDZ #3f NEQ ?missing
 #01 LDZ #00 EQU ?incomplete
 #02 LDZ #00 EQU ?incomplete
 #03 LDZ #00 EQU ?incomplete
 #05 LDZ ?followup
 #01 LDZ ;solution LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #02 LDZ ;solution INC2 LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #03 LDZ ;solution #0002 ADD2 LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #01 #04 STZ #0a !reply
@followup
 #01 LDZ ;followup-solution LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #02 LDZ ;followup-solution INC2 LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #03 LDZ ;followup-solution #0002 ADD2 LDA NEQ ?wrong
 #01 #04 STZ #0c !reply
@missing #07 !reply
@incomplete #08 !reply
@wrong #09
@reply
 #0900 STA
 #00 LDZ #0901 STA #01 LDZ #0902 STA #02 LDZ #0903 STA
 #03 LDZ #0904 STA #04 LDZ #0905 STA
 #06 #d9 DEO #d9 DEI ?done #01 #fe STZ
@done BRK
